- Replaced all `ce_cache__main["main_const_eval_N"]` with descriptive weight keys (e.g., `weights["model.rotary_emb.cos"]`, `weights["__consteval__.causal_mask"]`)
- Split multi-tensor key `main_const_eval_6` (list of 3) into `model.rotary_emb.cos`, `.sin`, `.freqs`
- Removed unused `import utils`, `import ttir_cpu`; added `import consteval`

